      "snippet": {
        "line": 604,
        "text": "deriv (radialProfile a τ) r = radialFirst a τ r, where radialFirst = spatialFirst a τ (r^2/2) * r and spatialFirst a τ s = s^(spatialExponent a - 1) * (spatialExponent a * profile a (2τ/s) - (2τ/s) * profileJet a 1 (2τ/s)); dividing by 2K = 2 s^(1/2-a) H gives rK_r/(2K) = -A - Z H'/H"
      }
